{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15956","headline":"秋千词 · 王建","name":"秋千词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长长丝绳紫复碧，嫋嫋横枝高百尺。\n少年儿女重秋千，盘巾结带分两边。\n身轻裙薄易生力，双手向空如鸟翼。\n下来立定重系衣，复畏斜风高不得。\n傍人送上那足贵，终赌鸣璫鬬自起。\n回回若与高树齐，头上宝钗从堕地。\n眼前争胜难爲休，足踏平地看始愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}